        "name": "Sneak Attack (2d6)",
        "source": "class",
        "text": "Once per turn, deal an extra 2d6 damage with a Finesse or Ranged weapon if you have Advantage, or an ally is within 5 ft of the target and you don't have Disadvantage."
      },
