        "text": "Bonus Action: Dash, Disengage, or Hide."
      },
      {
        "name": "Steady Aim",
        "source": "class",
        "text": "Bonus Action: give yourself Advantage on your next attack this turn, if you haven't moved. Your Speed is 0 until the end of the turn."
      },
